# CLAUDE.md

## Project Overview

Command Center is a WhatsApp conversation management platform built with NestJS (backend) and React (frontend) using Nx monorepo structure. It manages conversations with AI assistance, travel booking, file analysis, currency conversion, and Notion integration.

## Architecture

- `apps/api/` - NestJS backend (MongoDB, Mongoose, JWT auth)
- `apps/frontend/` - React 18 frontend (Material-UI, Tailwind CSS)
- `docs/` - Documentation and setup guides
- `.claude/agents/` - Custom Claude Code agents

**Key tech**: OpenAI/Gemini/Claude (multi-AI with failover), Twilio + WasenderAPI (WhatsApp), Pusher + Socket.io (real-time), AWS S3 (storage), Notion API, OneSignal (push notifications), BullMQ (jobs)

## Development Commands

```bash
npm run dev:both        # Start both frontend and API
npm run dev             # Frontend only (port 4200)
npm run dev:api         # API only (port 3001)
npx nx build api        # Build API
npx nx build frontend   # Build frontend
```
